#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Email"
msgstr "Email"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "lihi Short URL"
msgstr "lihi 短網址"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Email used to authenticate with the lihi service. Saving sends a verification email; the plugin can be used after verification is complete."
msgstr "用於 lihi 服務驗證身分的 Email；儲存後會寄送驗證信，驗證完成後方可使用套件。"

